 * **`SEPARATOR`**:
     The text string used to set the footnote separator. Defaults to `:`.
 
+* **`USE_DEFINITION_ORDER`**:
+    By default, footnotes are numbered and listed in the order of their first
+    reference in the document. Footnotes which are never referenced are listed
+    last, in the order they were defined. Set to `True` to number and list
+    footnotes in the order they are defined instead. Defaults to `False`.
